    "Advance RHBI from rhbi-v5 to rhbi-v6 under one unchanged global clock-free, shape-gate-free recipe: (1) couple Born-Infeld Lipschitz softplus sharpness settling directly to the 5-channel Kantorovich-Hellinger thermal scale via rhbi_settle_mode='thermal' (eff_beta = ebi_beta + rhbi_settle_beta * (1 - s_thermal)^2 with rhbi_settle_beta=16.0), replacing rhbi-v5's hardcoded 0.22 residual threshold so Lipschitz stiffening is identically zero throughout pre-equilibrium mode acquisition (s_thermal=1.0 whenever residual >= rhbi_thermal_tau=0.084) and engages smoothly only after thermal cooling begins; (2) retain pure fibre-centered paired relativistic generator updates without critic-side fibre blending (rhbi_fibre_rel_blend=0.0) while preserving Poisson-Weibull 1D AKT empirical OT horizon normalization (rhbi_akt_mode='weibull') and false-shock-proof thermal reopening (rhbi_thermal_shock_mu=0.35)."
